     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Aspect verbs",
     "texto": [
      "**Uczyć się** is «to study/learn» as a process; **nauczyć się** presents the result: to learn something.",
      "In the past and future, aspect helps show whether the action was in progress or was completed."
